== Icelandic ==
{{Icelandic declension kvk sb systir|föður}}
===Etymology===
From {{gen}} of ''[[faðir#Icelandic|faðir]]'' meaning "[[father]]" (= ''[[föður]]'' meaning "of a father") + ''[[systir#Icelandic|systir]]'' meaning "[[sister#English|sister]]". Literally meaning "sister of a father" or "father's sister".

=== Noun ===
'''föðursystir''' {{f}}
# [[paternal]] [[aunt]]

